<title>UK: S&amp;P rates Lodz long-term foreign, local currency.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Lodz long-term foreign, local currency.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it had assigned its BBB minus long-term foreign and local currency issuer credit ratings to the City of Lodz.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook is stable. This is the first Polish municipality to be rated,&quot; the rating agency said in a statement.  </p>
<p>&quot;Although the city will be challenged by further restructuring of its concentrated industrial base and large infrastructure needs will pressure the city's finances, prudent management is expected to keep budgetary deficits and debt growth under control,&quot; S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
